---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const email=import.meta.env.PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL;
---
<Base title="Contact" description="Contact On Simplicity about editorial questions, corrections or Resource Partners directory information." breadcrumbs={[{name:'Home',path:'/'},{name:'Contact'}]}><header class="page-header"><p class="eyebrow">Stay in touch</p><h1>A note to the journal.</h1><p>Questions, corrections and practical feedback are welcome.</p></header><article class="prose prose-stone max-w-none reading-width"><h2>Editorial questions and corrections</h2><p>If an article needs a correction, include its title, the page address and a clear description of the issue. For directory updates, include the business name and the information that needs to change. Please do not send sensitive personal, financial or medical information.</p>{email?<p>Email <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>.</p>:<p>Our editorial contact channel is being prepared. A direct contact address will be published here when it is available.</p>}<h2>Contacting a business</h2><p>For appointments, quotes, service availability or a question about a specific project, use the contact details on that business’s <a href="/resource-partners/">Resource Partners profile</a>. Independent businesses manage their own bookings and customer relationships; On Simplicity does not provide those services.</p></article></Base>
